Date: Sun, 1 Nov 2026 21:00:46 +0200
Subject: [PATCH] Shell: the server's games in the library, downloaded from
 their own page

Every game of the server's catalogue is in the library; its state (not downloaded, downloading, an update, data missing, Force Sign
needed) and primary action come from ShellStore. Force Sign is asked for once both the code and the data are in, a stopped download
resumes, and downloaded games are kept outside the bundle (Library/ShellGames) and restored after an app update.

Co-Authored-By: Claude Opus 5.5 <noreply@anthropic.com>

Upstream-Status: fork-only
Reason: the shell's server games in its library (patch 0057)
Issue: none (the fork Valtterios/NX2Apple has no issue tracker; branch duo-upstream)

---
 dm/ios/Shell/ShellApp.swift   |   6 +-
 dm/ios/Shell/ShellStore.swift | 150 +++++++++++++++++++++++++++++-----
 2 files changed, 134 insertions(+), 22 deletions(-)

